doc/machine_mvme88k.html:5:  <title>GXemul: MVME88K emulation</title>
doc/machine_mvme88k.html:12:<h1>GXemul: MVME88K emulation</h1>
doc/machine_mvme88k.html:56:<a name="openbsdmvme88kinstall"></a>
doc/machine_mvme88k.html:57:<h3>OpenBSD/mvme88k:</h3>
doc/machine_mvme88k.html:59:<p>It is possible to run <a href="http://www.openbsd.org/mvme88k.html">OpenBSD/mvme88k</a>
doc/machine_mvme88k.html:62:<p>To install OpenBSD/mvme88k onto an emulated harddisk image, follow these
doc/machine_mvme88k.html:69:	<b>dd if=/dev/zero of=obsd_mvme88k.img bs=1024 count=1 seek=1900000</b>
doc/machine_mvme88k.html:72:  <li>Download the entire mvme88k directory from the ftp server:<pre>
doc/machine_mvme88k.html:73:	<b>wget -np -l 0 -r <a href="https://ftp.nluug.nl/OpenBSD/4.5/mvme88k/">https://ftp.nluug.nl/OpenBSD/4.5/mvme88k/</a></b>
