doc/machine_sgi_o2.html:419:<a name="linuxforo2"></a>
doc/machine_sgi_o2.html:420:<h3>Linux for O2</h3>
doc/machine_sgi_o2.html:426:<p>Some kernels (Linux 2.5 and 2.6) from the years 2002 - 2004 can be found here: <a href="https://www.linux-mips.org/~glaurung/">https://www.linux-mips.org/~glaurung/</a>
doc/machine_sgi_o2.html:427:<br>Other kernels here: <a href="http://ftp.debian.org/debian/dists/Debian8.11/main/installer-mips/current/images/r5k-ip32/">Debian Linux for O2</a>
