web search: 'Bus Errors'
codex
The manuals do not support a blanket “real hardware would bus-error” claim. CRIME’s specification requires doubleword register accesses, but I have not found a specified response for byte or halfword accesses. Motorola explicitly permits small reads of VMEchip2 registers and faults small writes only in the local control register bank. I also found archived guest source in the parent directory and will check its VME accesses separately from the emulator code.
